-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=
 
ITEM SPINNER CONTROLS.
Copy the string below into the console, then change Maxspeed 30 to whatever number you want.
You MUST add quotation marks around Maxspeed X. I can't write it out here. Printl commands (to write these messages) won't allow it.
 
ent_fire turntable* addoutput maxspeed 30;ent_fire turntable* setspeed 1
 
Reverse spinner direction.
ent_fire turntable* reverse
 
Start/Stop rotation
ent_fire turntable_* toggle
 
Change angle - Requires quotationmarks around ''angles x y z''. only change middle number.
ent_fire turntable_* addoutput angles 0 180 0
 
